---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Disclaimer — Book Keeper"
	description="What Book Keeper is, how its content is generated, and who it is and isn't affiliated with."
>
	<article class="content-page">
		<div class="page-heading page-heading-solo">
			<h1 class="page-heading-title">Disclaimer</h1>
		</div>

		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				Book Keeper is a personal project for keeping notes on books I've read. It is not affiliated
				with, endorsed by, or connected to any of the authors, publishers, or other rights holders of
				the books referenced here.
			</p>
			<p>
				Chapter summaries, synopses, and key claims are generated by an AI language model from web
				search results, not from the original book text. They're a personal interpretation aid and may
				be incomplete, out of date, or simply wrong — don't treat anything here as a substitute for, or
				an accurate representation of, the actual book.
			</p>
			<p>Book covers are pulled from Open Library's public covers API and belong to their respective publishers.</p>
			<p>This is a non-commercial personal project, not run for profit.</p>
		</div>
	</article>
</Layout>

